<title>USA: Jefferson Smurfit COO Priestley resigns.</title>
<headline>Jefferson Smurfit COO Priestley resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CLAYTON, Mo. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferson Smurfit Corp said Friday its chief operating officer Eric Priestley has resigned.</p>
<p>Priestley's duties will be assumed by president and chief executive officer Richard Graham.  </p>
<p>A spokesman for Jefferson Smurfit declined to give additional information as to why Priestley resigned. Priestley joined the company in August, 1996.</p>
<p>Jefferson Smurfit is a paper, paperboard and packaging manufacturer. Jefferson Smurfit Group Plc of Dublin owns a 46.5 percent stake in the company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
